{"product_id":"tri-cut-spalted-tamarind-custom-cue-with-torrefied-maple-shaft","title":"Tri-Cut Spalted Tamarind Custom Cue with Torrefied Maple Shaft","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted for players who appreciate both performance and artistry, this custom cue blends premium materials with precision craftsmanship. The striking \u003cstrong\u003etri-cut Spalted Tamarind handle\u003c\/strong\u003e showcases the natural beauty of exotic wood, while the \u003cstrong\u003eEbony forearm and butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e provide timeless elegance and exceptional durability. Finished with shimmering \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, every cue is handcrafted to stand out on and off the table.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for a smooth, consistent hit, it features a \u003cstrong\u003eTorrefied Maple shaft\u003c\/strong\u003e that offers increased stability, reduced deflection, and excellent feedback. Combined with a \u003cstrong\u003eJuma ferrule\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue delivers exceptional cue ball control, spin, and accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOverall Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 59 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tri-Cut Spalted Tamarind\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Genuine Abalone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShaft:\u003c\/strong\u003e Torrefied Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip Diameter:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12.5 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTaper:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pro Taper\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/strong\u003e Juma\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Diamond\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandcrafted using premium exotic hardwoods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBeautiful tri-cut Spalted Tamarind handle with unique natural grain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElegant abalone inlays for a luxurious finish\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStable Torrefied Maple shaft for a crisp, consistent hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision-machined radial pin for a solid, reliable joint connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth pro taper for effortless stroke and cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt for serious players who demand performance without compromising style\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is individually handcrafted, making each piece one of a kind. The natural wood grain ensures no two cues are ever exactly alike.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43445513715760,"sku":null,"price":45000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul30_2026_08_22_24PM.png?v=1785414159","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\/tri-cut-spalted-tamarind-custom-cue-with-torrefied-maple-shaft","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}